{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本規則依土地法施行法第四十條之規定訂定之。","id":"D0060006/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"1c0d2ab618d2df9afc770af3dd9cacead2af5ee316a3e271f5d326cf866aafe9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":21,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"建築改良物估價，由市縣地政機關於辦理規定地價時間時為之。","id":"D0060006/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"55395ce099e5d94caf1ee0a814a25f78f12c4339557dd7247b05a3092f52227b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":28,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"建築改良物估價程序如左：\n一、調查。\n二、計算。\n三、評議。\n四、公布與通知。\n五、造冊。","id":"D0060006/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"1f5c27ca1024404452a24b2e3a271573be9491a062e3171427d5197376f7b9da","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":45,"children":[{"id":"D0060006/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":13,"end":19,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":19,"end":25,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:3/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":25,"end":31,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:3/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":31,"end":40,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:3/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":40,"end":45,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"建築改良物依其主體構造材料，分為左列七種：\n一、鋼鐵造者。\n二、鋼骨水泥造者。\n三、石造者。\n四、磚造者。\n五、土造者。\n六、木造者。\n七、竹造者。\n前項建築改良物種類，市縣地政機關得視實際情形再分細目。","id":"D0060006/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"6b59848c0fd125f502c5e660b065fe20474c650e1206efc2143d40ce766983df","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":75,"children":[{"id":"D0060006/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":22,"end":30,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":30,"end":40,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:4/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":40,"end":47,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:4/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":47,"end":54,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:4/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":54,"end":61,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:4/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":61,"end":68,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:4/p:1/i:7","kind":"item","number":7,"start":68,"end":75,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0060006/a:4/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":75,"end":102,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"建築改良物價調查表，應包括左列各事項，其格式由直轄市或縣（市）地政機關定之：\n一、建築改良物及建築地所有權人姓名、住址、地號。\n二、建築改良物之種類。（依本規則第四條所分之種類）\n三、建築改良物建築年月。\n四、建築改良物之建築情形及簡單圖說。\n五、建築改良物之使用狀況及其收益情形。\n六、建築改良物之耐用年限。\n七、建築改良物廢棄後之殘餘價值。\n八、建築改良物之面積（平方尺計）或體積。（立方尺計）\n九、建築改良物之買賣價格。\n十、建築改良物之附屬設備。如衛生、電氣等。\n十一、建築改良物建築時，所用各種工料之數量及其費用。\n十二、建築改良物之增修情形。\n十三、建築改良物佔地面積。\n十四、調查年、月、日。\n十五、調查員簽名、蓋章。","id":"D0060006/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"da0a83e15a56ef12c1e0d9db4bced76399e445672992abe75f97eb0699c37b35","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":316,"children":[{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":39,"end":64,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":64,"end":90,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":90,"end":103,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":103,"end":122,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":122,"end":142,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":142,"end":156,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:7","kind":"item","number":7,"start":156,"end":173,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:8","kind":"item","number":8,"start":173,"end":200,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:9","kind":"item","number":9,"start":200,"end":214,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:10","kind":"item","number":10,"start":214,"end":236,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:11","kind":"item","number":11,"start":236,"end":263,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:12","kind":"item","number":12,"start":263,"end":278,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:13","kind":"item","number":13,"start":278,"end":292,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:14","kind":"item","number":14,"start":292,"end":304,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:5/p:1/i:15","kind":"item","number":15,"start":304,"end":316,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"建築地之自然環境、經濟狀況，及其他可能影響建築改良物之耐用年限，及殘餘價值者，應查明記載於調查表備註欄內，以供計算建築改良物現值之參考。","id":"D0060006/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"84eb2737f40e870187fafd40d85038ab95a55a55704429ad495638c4f0e4f5b4","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":68,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"調查建築改良物價前，應調查當時各種建築材料之價格及工資支付標準，以為估計重新建築費用之依據。","id":"D0060006/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"bef959bd9fc1e10e7b1f105d65d38bf105b51f12416a16e015ed856c5deca088","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":46,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"以同樣建築改良物為重新建築所須費用之求得，應按實際需要情形，以淨計法或立方尺法或平方尺法計算之。\n前項淨計法，僅適用於都市建築改良物估價。","id":"D0060006/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"6f5da20cc9fe01865cdcc1c1462bf88da83713b3288cb00bf475ca8dec5c62d1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":49,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:8/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":49,"end":69,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"依淨計法求重新建築所需費用，應就建築改良物所需各種建築材料之數量及工數，逐一乘以估價時各該同樣建築材料之單價及工資支付標準，再將所得之積加之。\n前項建築材料之數量及工數，如有建築時之承建包單或其他書面記載，確實可憑者，依其記載。","id":"D0060006/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"363ed88e797073eacdc3c95990c924e15aed1d7fd395c8c16d45ed56e876234a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":72,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:9/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":72,"end":114,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"依立方尺法求重新建築所需費用，應先測計建築改良物之立方尺總數，乘以估價時同樣建築每立方尺所需工料費用。","id":"D0060006/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"18075f9bc61bc1a28c36be7580cb821e6383f1e80a271db3ef6bd62d5c31f3d4","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":51,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"依平方尺法求重新建築所需費用，應先測計建築改良物之平方尺總數，乘以估價時同樣建築每平方尺所需工料費用。","id":"D0060006/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"c4cebe93641929107b7ab0bbec59ef0d65d6ebf3cb5949fb3a65c2ae24d4bf6f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":51,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":[],"text":"重新建築費用求得後，應由該費用總額內減去因時間經歷所受損耗，即為該建築改良物之現值。","id":"D0060006/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"888d774678137c0ac0cba1dbc83c3ba9b35d138ad09e5ad50159cff5d142e1d5","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":42,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":[],"text":"鋼鐵造、鋼骨水泥造、石造，其現值用左列公式計算之。\n         ┌──\n一、 1－NS/V  ＝R\n二、 V（1-R）m＝M\n上式中：\nV 表示建築改良物之建築費用總額。\nN 表示建築改良物之耐用年數。\nS 表示建築改良物廢棄後之殘餘價值。\nR 表示建築改良物之折舊率。\nm 表示建築改良物之經歷年數。\nM 表示建築改良物之經歷 m年後之現值。","id":"D0060006/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"64ef2fc66daab5c888262defa7b0811f0085e59080c3fc357c735c9ad72224a7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"含表格或縮排續行，保留原文待核對。"}},{"no":"第 14 條","path":[],"text":"土造、木造、竹造，其現值用左列公式計算之：\n一、（ V－S） ／ N＝D\n二、 V－mD＝M\n上式中：\nD 表示每年之平均折舊額。\nS 、N 、V 、m 、M 同前條。","id":"D0060006/a:14","anchor":"a-14","contentHash":"03ca6ffa0b52cabd48a333f125aebcb0597419dba859f4a5966b9a6075831a48","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"段落界線不明確。"}},{"no":"第 15 條","path":[],"text":"磚造建築改良物之現值，得視該建築改良物耐用年限之久暫，就第十三、第十四兩條所定計算方法中，選用一法計算之。","id":"D0060006/a:15","anchor":"a-15","contentHash":"4b7787218cbefc978dacc06b2d57e4c569aa82c15ca7237bf5fc73cea8d7bb85","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:15/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":53,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 16 條","path":[],"text":"一宗地上建築改良物不屬一人所有，其有顯明界限者，應分別計算之。界限不清者，仍作一宗計算，按各所有人權利價值大小註明之。","id":"D0060006/a:16","anchor":"a-16","contentHash":"69a0f20f816c45d853fb877a068a5d67b159e2ec8f3237dd0cf90ab951513aeb","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:16/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":59,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 17 條","path":[],"text":"市縣地政機關將建築改良物價值計算完竣，送經標準地價評議委員會評定後，應即報請該管市縣政府公布之，並分別將估定價額，以書面通知所有權人。","id":"D0060006/a:17","anchor":"a-17","contentHash":"6899e218eceefce06cd48f6b03d56d9b36b267263ddc521592859cf2473f54ba","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:17/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":67,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 18 條","path":[],"text":"（刪除）","id":"D0060006/a:18","anchor":"a-18","contentHash":"bcd3802fb362258544f58c9ce653f61fd0319535b923ab633d178745f30ee6d1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:18/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":4,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 19 條","path":[],"text":"（刪除）","id":"D0060006/a:19","anchor":"a-19","contentHash":"bcd3802fb362258544f58c9ce653f61fd0319535b923ab633d178745f30ee6d1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:19/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":4,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 20 條","path":[],"text":"建築改良物價值，經過公布通知程序不發生異議，或發生異議經標準地價評議委員會重新評定者，為建築改良物之法定價值。","id":"D0060006/a:20","anchor":"a-20","contentHash":"b57a544ceb8dbeaece22c8e152d8460e905f11e51eace24bddcaca23f46c9756","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:20/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":55,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 21 條","path":[],"text":"建築改良物之法定價值，應分別編入地價冊及總歸戶冊內。\n前項總歸戶冊編竣後，應移送該管市縣財政機關。","id":"D0060006/a:21","anchor":"a-21","contentHash":"5970895c64c4db98e94c3d42f767fac7a56c7477046af85634a042b7c32abbb7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:21/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":27,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:21/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":27,"end":49,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 22 條","path":[],"text":"就原建築改良物增加之改良物，於重新估價時，併合於原改良物計算之。但因維持建築改良物現狀所為之修繕，不視為增加之改良物。","id":"D0060006/a:22","anchor":"a-22","contentHash":"093ab9c5e12b5785cf83699c008dad8531b5e855882f69330b3ad6e534dfd6cc","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:22/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":59,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 23 條","path":[],"text":"建築改良物價值，得於辦理重估地價時，依本規則之規定重為估定但因改良物有增減或重大改變者不在此限。","id":"D0060006/a:23","anchor":"a-23","contentHash":"f06930ebac8c31ae47349492f2e28f7dff3fe0dc378fc6e003f426cdcad2acd6","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:23/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":48,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 24 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市或縣（市）地政機關得參酌地方實際情形，依本規則之規定，制定施行細則，報請中央地政機關備案。\n前項施行細則，應參酌各地方自然環境規定各種建築改良物之耐用年限。","id":"D0060006/a:24","anchor":"a-24","contentHash":"f84943e9fcb60800e5a3af57752a224431afa6ba45c5957eb7e4208d8f2c4ecc","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:24/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":49,"children":[]},{"id":"D0060006/a:24/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":49,"end":81,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 25 條","path":[],"text":"簡陋及臨時性之建築改良物，免予估價。","id":"D0060006/a:25","anchor":"a-25","contentHash":"f4641fd23c6ca44c0e8f42864c20ffe6e0d7e722b4f350f316a202eabab445d7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:25/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":18,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 26 條","path":[],"text":"本規則自公布之日施行。","id":"D0060006/a:26","anchor":"a-26","contentHash":"026fe4b9192d9d86f86decc31e97ed56d0877b583ee107276a9606219150a61d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0060006/a:26/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":11,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[{"title":"第 13 條完整條文.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000036165"}],"category":"都市計畫與土地","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國三十五年十月二十八日地政署（35）京價字第 0203 號令訂定\n  發布全文 25 條；並自公布同日施行\n2.中華民國八十八年六月二十九日內政部（88）台內地字第 8889891  號\n  令修正發布第 5、24  條條文\n3.中華民國九十九年六月二十四日內政部台內地字第 0990119681 號令刪\n  除發布第 18、19 條條文","id":"D0060006","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2010-06-24","name":"土地建築改良物估價規則","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0060006","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"e1ece2fba4a737746caa513860e33b7f7538c707bca310fedc1bf73648175816","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2010-06-24","effectiveDate":""}}